                "loc": "ISA.55.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 55:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bagire oti: Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Niinyerahira, tinshemerererwa kufa kw'omubi, kureka omubi okureka omuhanda gwe, akaba ohuriire; muhindukye, muhindukye murekye emihanda yaanyu emibi. Mbwenu nimwendera ki kufa, imwe nju ya Israeli 'mwe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
