              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bus 7:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi iwe, Mwana w'omuntu, gambira abantu baawe oti: Ohikiriire, ku arishiisha, okuhikiirira kwe tikurimukiza; kandi omubi, ku arihinduka yaareka obubi bwe, obwo bubi bwe buryaba butakimwita; kandi ohikiriire, ku arishiisha, taribaasa kubaisibwaho okuhikiirira kwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'obu naakugambira ohikiriire nti: Buzimazima oryaba ohuriire, kwonka ku arysiga okuhikiirira kwe, yaakora eby'okushiisha, tihariho na kimwe omu by'okuhikiirira bye ekiriijukwa; kureka aryafeera omu by'okushiisha bye ebi akozire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
