                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omukono gwa MUKAMA gukaba guraire guunyizireho omu mwabazyo, ogwo mushaija ocwire atakaizire; kandi MUKAMA akaba yaayashamize akanwa kangye, obu ogwo mushaija yampikaho omu kasheeshe; ntyo naagamba, tinaaguma ndi ekiteta.",
          "type": "text",
